  "description": "A provider-agnostic secrets abstraction for the GM.* ecosystem. ISecretsService (GetSecret / GetRequiredSecret / typed GetSecret<T>) over a pluggable ISecretsProvider, with config-driven provider selection and optional TTL caching via GM.Caching — so remote lookups (Key Vault, Secrets Manager, Vault) are cheap and rotation happens automatically on cache expiry. Consumers depend only on the interface; the backend is chosen by configuration. Add a provider with GM.Secrets.Environment / GM.Secrets.Configuration.",
